# UX workflow: copy one sequencer page and preview normal-mode paste targets.
# Purpose: validates clipboard source marker plus overwrite/free paste previews
# outside structure selection mode.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen track_focus

# Enter page focus from the default track focus.
150 tap NAV 60
350 capture screen page_focus

# Create page 2 and copy it.
450 encoder NAV 1
550 capture screen page_2_add_preview
650 tap NAV 60
850 capture screen page_2_created
950 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
1150 capture screen page_2_copied

# Move to active page 1. Paste preview should show source page 2 in blue and
# overwrite target page 1 in amber. Holding paste should use the overwrite
# warning tone.
1250 encoder NAV -1
1450 capture screen paste_preview_overwrite_page_1
1550 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
2100 tick
2150 capture screen paste_hold_overwrite_armed
2650 tick
2700 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
2950 capture screen page_1_overwritten

# Move to inactive page 3. Paste preview should show source page 2 in blue and
# free target page 3 in green. Holding paste should use the constructive tone.
3050 encoder NAV 1
3150 encoder NAV 1
3350 capture screen paste_preview_free_page_3
3450 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
4000 tick
4050 capture screen paste_hold_free_armed
4550 tick
4600 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
4850 capture screen page_3_pasted
